# @mr/ui is the private package @andrii2706/mr-ui from GitHub Packages. No token is ever written here:
# locally — the NODE_AUTH_TOKEN variable (a classic token with read:packages), CI — GITHUB_TOKEN,
# Docker — the build secret npm_token, Firebase App Hosting — the secret GITHUB_PACKAGES_TOKEN.
@andrii2706:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
